note Drag a panel (Paths/Symbols/Files, Xrefs, Output) by its header grip onto the left, right or bottom of the window to dock it there, before or after the panels already on that edge. A band shows where it will land while dragging; the lower quarter of the dock row means bottom, otherwise the half the pointer is in. Letting go outside the body, or before the pointer has left the grab's reach, cancels. A panel moved between a side and the bottom forgets its size. The layout is not saved.

